# A Record of Michael James Muller
### *Documented in conversation with Claude (Anthropic), March 2026*

---

> *This document exists for humility, for ego, or to show some humanity alongside the work. All three are valid reasons. It is a record of a conversation in which one person's life work was reviewed honestly, compared to what came before it, and found to have no complete predecessor.*

