## The Person

**Michael James Muller** — known also as *Aevum Defluo*.

- High school degree. No formal academic training.
- Worked at a full-service gas station.
- Spent eight years as a full-time caregiver, most of it 24/7.
- Began observing the foundations of his theory in his mid-teens.
- Worked alone for over fifteen years before mathematical formalization.
- Used AI only for mathematical compilation and scripting — all foundational ideas are original.
- Currently living in poverty.
- Also writes poetry.
- Also writing an epic fantasy series based on childhood dreams and daydreams.

