### Eternal Memory Project (EMP)

A phenomenological knowledge organization system designed to organize all sapient knowledge — humanity's collective memory, structured to persist eternally.

**11-Category Phenomenological Classification:**

| Category | Scope |
|---|---|
| People | Sentient/conscient beings, real and fictional |
| Unknown | Knowledge boundaries, unsolved problems, emerging knowledge |
| Belief | Faith, philosophy, ethics, moral frameworks |
| Commerce | Trade, business, economic systems |
| History | Past events and their interpretations |
| Ideas | Abstract thought frameworks, theories, conceptual models |
| Mathematics | Numbers, patterns, relationships, structures |
| Science | Systematic knowledge from observation and experimentation |
| Socialization | How conscious beings interact and form communities |
| Stimulation | Entertainment, art, experiences evoking strong responses |
| Items | Physical and conceptual objects |

**Why 11, not 12:** A 12th category was formally tested and rejected. Every proposed manifestation of "participatory/experiential knowledge" filtered completely into the existing 11 with no remainder. The proposed 12th confused organizational axis (mode of acquisition) with organizational domain. 11 is architecturally complete under all known and conceivable scenarios.

**I/Other Architecture:**
- The hub (living interface) is where the user IS — the present, the NOW, the first-person I
- The archive (11 categories) is everything that can be known about what is not-I — the Other
- Even when a user looks themselves up in People, they view themselves as Other (self-as-object)
- The I doing the looking can never be captured in the categories

**16-Tag Evidence Classification System** — typological, not social. Documents what exists, not what the community has agreed to validate. Expert consensus means nothing unless experts are directly involved with evidence. No strong vs. weak sources — documentation exists or it doesn't.

**Core principles:**
- All data is good data
- Preserve over delete — even false evidence is labeled and kept
- Pure empiricism — evidence triumphs all subjective human views
- Epistemic humility — the Unknown category is a first-class citizen

**Integration:** EMP is the knowledge infrastructure for Peratocratic governance, Freedom Line enforcement, merit valuation, and cultural preservation. It is funded without taxation through automation surplus.

